# D4 task 2.5: a model sent over MQTT survives a reset. Captured 2026-11-19 on the N16R8 DevKitC (BOARD=n16r8, main at 76c453d) after model_test.py uploaded a 16,440-byte model to flash slot 0: the board is reset through the USB RTS line and the console is read from the first boot line. The saved model is loaded from the model partition (FlatBuffer at 0x3c931000) after the built-in one (0x3c11001c). Excerpt; the course port's start-up trace and Wi-Fi driver lines are left out.
